Hello,

The oscillo() function does not have an y-axis unit as, as you suggested, the input can vary on any range depending on the source file format. The values are often not calibrated, ie no absolute pressure (Pa) or electrical (mV) can be obtained. In most cases, it is therefore better to think this axis as a relative amplitude scale without unit.

HTH

Jerome

